  "question": {
    "text": "The enthalpies of combustion of carbon and carbon monoxide are $-393.5$ and $-283 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$ respectively. The enthalpy of formation of carbon monoxide per mole is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
